WEBVTT

00:14.889 --> 00:17.183
It's spring break!

00:17.851 --> 00:19.310
You sure are cheerful, Miki.

00:19.394 --> 00:20.562
Who wouldn't be? Look.

00:20.645 --> 00:22.814
We're at a theme park!

00:23.398 --> 00:25.066
Exams are over,
and spring break has begun.

00:25.150 --> 00:28.903
What's a better way to spend it
than hanging out with friends?

00:28.987 --> 00:32.115
This is what high school's about!

00:32.198 --> 00:35.118
Hey, guys! Thanks for waiting.

00:35.201 --> 00:36.327
There you are.

00:36.411 --> 00:38.496
Heya, Minato and Yota.

00:38.997 --> 00:40.331
Sorry, did we keep you waiting?

00:40.415 --> 00:41.416
Nope.

00:41.499 --> 00:42.584
Huh?

00:43.334 --> 00:46.838
What's this, Minato?
Your outfit's on point today!

00:47.505 --> 00:50.216
I've only seen you in casual outfits.

00:50.300 --> 00:51.926
LIVE FEED - MINATO'S ROOM
MESSY

00:52.010 --> 00:53.344
This is my casual fit.

00:54.304 --> 00:56.639
- Well, shall we get going?
- Wait for me, Minato.

00:56.723 --> 00:57.724
POWER WALKING

00:57.807 --> 00:59.601
Let's go, Koyun.

00:59.684 --> 01:00.769
Okay.

01:00.852 --> 01:04.856
At Miki's suggestion,
the four of us came to the theme park.

02:36.531 --> 02:40.952
EPISODE 10
SPRING

02:41.035 --> 02:42.203
ENTRANCE

02:42.287 --> 02:45.415
Glad it's a nice, warm day.

02:45.498 --> 02:48.334
I love the feeling of the season changing.

02:48.418 --> 02:49.711
I know what you mean.

02:49.794 --> 02:51.004
MEMORIES TIED TO THE CLIMATE

02:51.087 --> 02:52.881
It reminds me of the entrance ceremony.

02:52.964 --> 02:53.965
MEMORIES - CLIMATE

02:54.048 --> 02:56.593
It takes me back
to the day my younger siblings were born.

02:58.052 --> 03:00.346
Were you and your siblings born in spring?

03:00.430 --> 03:02.849
Yep, all April babies.

03:02.932 --> 03:07.270
Koyun, your birthday's in February,
so you're almost a full year younger.

03:07.353 --> 03:08.855
You're right.

03:08.938 --> 03:12.358
February? That's pretty recent.
You should've told us.

03:14.277 --> 03:15.612
Was I supposed to?

03:16.195 --> 03:17.488
SHOCK

03:17.572 --> 03:20.742
Excuse me. Can I get a birthday sticker?

03:20.825 --> 03:21.910
Here you go.

03:21.993 --> 03:23.244
But my birthday was last month--

03:23.328 --> 03:24.662
STICK

03:27.498 --> 03:29.000
Look over there.

03:29.083 --> 03:30.168
PHOTO SHOOT OK!
ZONED OUT

03:30.251 --> 03:32.503
The mascot looks bored.
Let's have it celebrate you.

03:33.171 --> 03:35.548
Celebrate me?
And what's that thing supposed to be?

03:35.632 --> 03:37.550
Don't be shy. Go, go, go.

03:40.220 --> 03:44.224
Seriously, Yota... he's such a dad.

03:44.849 --> 03:45.934
There.

03:47.018 --> 03:49.729
- Dance with me.
- It's a bunny.

03:49.812 --> 03:51.731
Uppi, uppi!

03:51.814 --> 03:52.815
That's wacky.

03:52.899 --> 03:54.108
- Someone help...
- Uppi!

03:56.110 --> 03:57.195
SNAP, SNAP

03:57.278 --> 03:58.279
I endorse this coupling.

04:00.031 --> 04:02.617
Look, they're selling a ton of merch.

04:02.700 --> 04:07.163
I'm kinda into this cheesy merch.

04:09.040 --> 04:11.125
Cheesy?

04:11.209 --> 04:12.627
UPPI BADGE SET
680 YEN (WITHOUT TAX)

04:12.710 --> 04:14.879
- Thank you.
- Uppippi!

04:14.963 --> 04:17.382
The mascot's the cashier?

04:17.966 --> 04:21.135
I got some cute merch. Now I'm satisfied.

04:21.219 --> 04:23.137
Hold on, what about the rides?

04:23.221 --> 04:26.140
We haven't been on a single ride
since we got here.

04:26.224 --> 04:28.518
No way! But we're having so much fun.

04:29.018 --> 04:30.478
Then what if we go do that one?

04:30.979 --> 04:32.897
HOUSE OF HORRORS

04:34.983 --> 04:36.526
No!

04:36.609 --> 04:38.278
Calm down, Miki.

04:38.361 --> 04:39.946
It's just a prop. You're okay.

04:40.029 --> 04:42.907
Koyun, no need to call it what it is.

04:45.243 --> 04:47.745
I know what happens.
When we walk past the coffins,

04:47.829 --> 04:50.540
the lids will swing open. I'm so done!

04:50.623 --> 04:52.917
You'll be fine. Here, look.

04:55.753 --> 04:56.754
HORROR

04:56.838 --> 04:58.798
They put a lot of effort into this.

04:59.299 --> 05:00.925
This is right up Tsukiko's alley.

05:01.968 --> 05:03.803
This skull looks very realistic.

05:04.304 --> 05:05.471
Right, Amamiya--

05:06.639 --> 05:08.725
Don't look, don't look, don't look...

05:08.808 --> 05:09.809
I can't even!

05:12.395 --> 05:15.481
Take me away, Yota.

05:15.565 --> 05:17.317
Sure. Yeah, okay.

05:18.151 --> 05:19.152
CRASH

05:19.235 --> 05:20.236
DROOP

05:20.320 --> 05:21.321
ROUTE

05:21.404 --> 05:22.822
Yota, that way to the exit.

05:22.905 --> 05:25.074
EXIT

05:29.162 --> 05:31.539
Moving on! On to the next one!

05:31.622 --> 05:33.082
She's back to life.

05:42.550 --> 05:43.843
Yay!

05:45.803 --> 05:46.804
Yeah!

05:51.976 --> 05:52.977
Yes!

05:53.061 --> 05:55.646
Let's do this one together next.
It's their main attraction.

05:55.730 --> 05:57.148
FAMOUS CYCLE MONORAIL
SCENIC VIEW

05:57.231 --> 05:58.232
I'll pass.

05:58.316 --> 05:59.317
UGH...

05:59.400 --> 06:01.569
Sorry. I need a break.

06:01.652 --> 06:02.653
Me too.

06:03.613 --> 06:06.032
Guess all that spinning got to me.

06:06.115 --> 06:07.158
Same here.

06:07.241 --> 06:08.242
So...

06:08.326 --> 06:10.661
sorry, but the two of you go on ahead.

06:10.745 --> 06:11.746
THE TWO OF YOU

06:12.330 --> 06:13.664
Koyun!

06:13.748 --> 06:17.710
Looks like the wait time's much longer
than we thought, Yota.

06:20.129 --> 06:21.464
Whoa, hey!

06:24.383 --> 06:25.760
Watch your step!

06:26.344 --> 06:27.512
Sorry.

06:27.595 --> 06:28.763
It's fine.

06:30.431 --> 06:31.516
How do I put it...

06:32.141 --> 06:33.518
Yota's a bit...

06:39.440 --> 06:42.527
The sea. It's glimmering!

06:42.610 --> 06:45.613
I get a bit nervous if I look down.

06:45.696 --> 06:49.033
He seems put together,
but he's actually pretty spacey.

06:49.117 --> 06:51.577
He's like a big baby.

06:57.708 --> 06:59.293
Miki and Yota,

07:00.044 --> 07:02.463
they looked like a couple enjoying a date.

07:06.509 --> 07:08.719
Huh? This situation's like...

07:08.803 --> 07:09.804
BA-BUMP

07:09.887 --> 07:11.222
It's as if we're on a date--

07:11.305 --> 07:12.515
Amamiya.

07:13.224 --> 07:16.185
Do you feel a bit sick today?

07:16.727 --> 07:17.979
Are we pushing you too hard?

07:18.062 --> 07:19.147
Not in the slightest.

07:19.730 --> 07:20.982
I've felt great all day.

07:21.065 --> 07:22.066
UPPI SAMBA

07:22.150 --> 07:23.151
Yeah?

07:23.234 --> 07:24.735
IN FACT, HE WAS EXCITED
SINCE YESTERDAY

07:24.819 --> 07:26.237
I got a little queasy is all.

07:26.320 --> 07:28.489
Huh... Then, maybe he's...

07:29.073 --> 07:32.368
Hey. I wanna play that game while we wait.

07:35.872 --> 07:38.791
Do you go to the arcade a lot?

07:38.875 --> 07:40.835
Yeah, I like 'em.

07:41.335 --> 07:42.712
Watch me.

07:44.422 --> 07:45.506
He's a playful guy.

07:47.341 --> 07:48.593
There!

07:49.510 --> 07:50.803
Strike!

07:50.887 --> 07:52.722
You got it on your first try.

07:52.805 --> 07:55.016
We've got a winner!

07:55.099 --> 07:57.477
Pick one prize from here.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.853
UPPI

07:58.936 --> 08:00.313
It's full of that mascot thing...

08:01.522 --> 08:02.690
PRIZES

08:02.773 --> 08:03.900
Now that's cute.

08:05.485 --> 08:06.903
I'll take that one.

08:06.986 --> 08:07.987
All right.

08:08.988 --> 08:11.574
Amamiya has a real dog at home.

08:11.657 --> 08:12.825
A REAL DOG

08:12.909 --> 08:16.329
- We went off of my preference.
- Here.

08:16.412 --> 08:17.580
PUFFY

08:18.748 --> 08:19.790
You can have it.

08:22.084 --> 08:25.087
Happy birthday, Koyun.

08:27.465 --> 08:28.966
Huh? What?

08:29.050 --> 08:30.551
Huh? What?

08:30.635 --> 08:32.553
NOT USED TO BEING CELEBRATED

08:33.513 --> 08:34.514
What?

08:35.556 --> 08:37.558
PUFFY - FLUFFY

08:38.100 --> 08:39.477
FUZZY...

08:41.687 --> 08:42.688
Thanks.

08:45.316 --> 08:47.151
CLENCH

08:47.235 --> 08:49.237
When's your birthday, Amamiya?

08:49.320 --> 08:51.155
Will you do something for me?

08:51.239 --> 08:52.240
SWOOSH

08:52.323 --> 08:54.242
No, don't expect anything special...

08:57.745 --> 08:59.247
There you are.

08:59.330 --> 09:00.331
BAM

09:00.414 --> 09:01.958
What the heck happened?

09:06.045 --> 09:07.463
SEE YOU NEXT TIME

09:07.547 --> 09:09.006
That was a blast.

09:09.590 --> 09:11.926
Where do you wanna go for dinner?

09:12.009 --> 09:13.594
I'll look up some places.
What kind of food?

09:13.678 --> 09:14.679
STARE - PET, PET

09:14.762 --> 09:16.514
- We walked a lot today.
- Say...

09:16.597 --> 09:18.349
If I'm picking,
then I want to pile up on meat.

09:18.432 --> 09:19.642
What is it?

09:19.725 --> 09:21.852
Are you maybe...

09:22.937 --> 09:24.522
not good with horror?

09:26.649 --> 09:27.900
Right, Amamiya--

09:29.068 --> 09:30.987
DEAD SILENT

09:31.612 --> 09:33.489
AGAPE...

09:35.032 --> 09:37.493
What? What gives you that idea?

09:38.828 --> 09:40.997
Huh? Hold on.

09:41.080 --> 09:43.291
How'd you know? Was it that obvious?

09:44.083 --> 09:45.876
I mean...

09:45.960 --> 09:49.088
I thought it'd be
something for little kids.

09:49.714 --> 09:52.466
Man, this is embarrassing...

09:52.550 --> 09:56.470
Maybe because his reaction
was contrary to my expectation...

09:57.471 --> 10:00.099
Hey... Why're you looking at me like that?

10:01.392 --> 10:02.643
Sorry, it's just...

10:03.227 --> 10:04.687
"It's just..." what?

10:05.813 --> 10:07.148
Wait up.

10:07.231 --> 10:08.441
POWER WALKING
RUNNING AWAY - GIGGLE

10:08.524 --> 10:10.151
- That's mean.
- She's fast.

10:10.735 --> 10:12.862
For the first time in my life,

10:13.362 --> 10:15.364
I thought a guy was cute.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.992
NEW SEMESTER

10:21.996 --> 10:23.497
GRADE 2, CLASS 2

10:31.464 --> 10:32.840
Koyuki.

10:33.341 --> 10:35.009
Good morning.

10:35.676 --> 10:37.011
Tsukiko.

10:37.595 --> 10:39.847
I'm glad we're in the same class again.

10:39.930 --> 10:41.515
I'm looking forward
to being your classmate.

10:41.599 --> 10:42.767
Me too.

10:42.850 --> 10:45.728
Not many of the students in this class
are from Grade 1, Class 2.

10:45.811 --> 10:48.105
I hardly recognize anyone.
I'm a bit nervous.

10:48.689 --> 10:50.524
Do you know anyone?

10:50.608 --> 10:52.318
Yeah, I see a few familiar faces...

10:52.401 --> 10:53.778
Koyun.

10:54.445 --> 10:55.780
Morning.

10:56.572 --> 10:57.782
Morning, Yota.

11:00.618 --> 11:03.037
How nice, you're so tall!

11:03.120 --> 11:04.538
SHE ADMIRES TALL PEOPLE

11:04.622 --> 11:07.041
- I know exactly how you feel.
- Wait, what?

11:08.542 --> 11:09.669
Yota.

11:09.752 --> 11:11.545
Hey, Minato. Good morning.

11:11.629 --> 11:12.755
Good morning.

11:13.381 --> 11:14.674
Good morning to you too, Koyun--

11:15.549 --> 11:17.551
Yes! You're all here!

11:17.635 --> 11:20.096
This isn't a dream, right?

11:20.179 --> 11:22.515
We're all in the same class, right?

11:22.598 --> 11:24.934
- You're not dreaming. Morning.
- Good morning.

11:25.893 --> 11:27.812
Wait, this means you're...

11:28.437 --> 11:30.439
Grade 2, Class 2, Number 2.

11:30.523 --> 11:32.274
Meow, meow, meow.

11:32.358 --> 11:33.651
Meow.

11:33.734 --> 11:36.946
Since I'm Grade 2, Class 2, Number 22...

11:37.029 --> 11:38.489
You're a meow, meow, meow, meow!

11:39.532 --> 11:41.784
It's Azumi!

11:42.410 --> 11:45.079
But Azumi...

11:48.874 --> 11:50.876
isn't quite how I expected her to be.

11:52.044 --> 11:55.214
It's great to meet you. I'm Miki.

11:56.257 --> 11:59.093
You're... You're so cool.

11:59.176 --> 12:02.596
SO COOL

12:02.680 --> 12:03.681
THRILLED - SQUEEZE

12:03.764 --> 12:04.932
Squeeze!

12:05.015 --> 12:06.851
Good for you, Miki.

12:06.934 --> 12:09.770
- I couldn't stop myself from hugging you.
- Azumi...

12:09.854 --> 12:12.356
She's like a completely different person
from last year.

12:12.440 --> 12:15.109
She was your hopes and dreams, huh?

12:15.693 --> 12:17.361
Minato.

12:17.445 --> 12:19.655
Can you do something about him?

12:19.738 --> 12:22.575
Why am I the only one
in a different class?

12:22.658 --> 12:23.659
GRADE 2, CLASS 1

12:23.742 --> 12:25.369
Hayato's been whining all morning.

12:26.287 --> 12:27.455
Wow.

12:27.538 --> 12:29.874
- Thanks for everything, Hayato.
- You're so heartless!

12:29.957 --> 12:30.958
SCREAM

12:31.041 --> 12:32.042
What's your name?

12:32.126 --> 12:33.127
I'm Tsukiko.

12:33.210 --> 12:34.712
Tsukko then.

12:35.212 --> 12:37.131
I'm Yota. Nice to meet you.

12:37.214 --> 12:38.424
FLOATY

12:38.507 --> 12:39.884
Floating away.

12:44.013 --> 12:45.139
SIGH

12:45.222 --> 12:48.976
It's, like, so lively in there.

12:49.477 --> 12:52.897
It's going to be completely different
from Grade 1, Class 2.

12:53.898 --> 12:56.066
Still, I don't hate it.

12:56.567 --> 12:57.776
Koyun.

12:58.444 --> 13:00.488
Sorry, we didn't mean to push you out.

13:01.113 --> 13:02.865
Were we too loud?

13:03.365 --> 13:05.493
Huh? Not at all.

13:06.243 --> 13:10.039
Just thought there's no point
for me to be in there.

13:10.122 --> 13:12.708
- What?
- Rather, sorry I made you worried.

13:13.209 --> 13:15.419
This is difficult...

13:15.503 --> 13:18.797
HE LOVES CROWDS
SHE LOVES SPACE

13:18.881 --> 13:19.882
GRADE 2, CLASS 3

13:19.965 --> 13:21.675
Is it okay to leave that person alone?

13:21.759 --> 13:23.302
THAT PERSON

13:23.928 --> 13:26.388
He likes to put on his loud comedy act.

13:27.640 --> 13:28.974
A loud comedy act.

13:33.938 --> 13:35.940
Listen...

13:36.023 --> 13:39.902
I'm really glad we're in the same class.

13:43.197 --> 13:44.198
Me too.

13:45.533 --> 13:48.577
You feel more at ease
when there's a familiar face in class.

13:49.537 --> 13:50.704
Right.

13:50.788 --> 13:52.706
A FAMILIAR FACE

13:53.290 --> 13:57.044
- Do you see that guy's hair?
- He's locked in.

13:57.586 --> 14:00.464
Crap, what's my class again?

14:01.090 --> 14:04.885
Second years are in charge
of club introduction skits, right?

14:04.969 --> 14:05.970
Yeah.

14:06.053 --> 14:08.681
I already know it'll be corny
so I don't want to participate.

14:09.181 --> 14:10.224
I want to go watch it.

14:10.307 --> 14:12.560
Seriously, don't come.

14:13.769 --> 14:14.853
Hey!

14:14.937 --> 14:16.188
SQUEEZE

14:19.483 --> 14:20.734
Who is it?

14:21.318 --> 14:22.611
Who is it?

14:24.029 --> 14:25.614
This voice...

14:25.698 --> 14:27.032
Yuki.

14:27.116 --> 14:28.367
Bingo.

14:28.450 --> 14:30.160
That's my Koyun.

14:30.244 --> 14:31.245
Koyun?

14:31.328 --> 14:33.747
You're the only one
who'd pull a prank like this.

14:33.831 --> 14:35.040
They're friends?

14:35.541 --> 14:38.335
That's fine,
but get your hand off her already.

14:40.504 --> 14:43.215
Amamiya, meet Yuki.

14:43.299 --> 14:44.425
He's Miki's younger brother.

14:44.508 --> 14:47.011
What's up? I'm Yuki Azumi.

14:47.094 --> 14:49.680
Huh? Miki's brother?

14:50.306 --> 14:51.557
He's my younger brother.

14:51.640 --> 14:54.935
We grew up together,
and he's her childhood friend.

14:55.019 --> 14:56.770
Oh, I see.

14:56.854 --> 14:59.273
Amamiya?

14:59.356 --> 15:01.275
Could you be Minato?

15:01.358 --> 15:03.652
- What?
- I totally know you.

15:03.736 --> 15:05.613
Miki's mentioned your name before.

15:05.696 --> 15:06.697
It's rude to point.

15:06.780 --> 15:09.533
Thanks for being good to my sister.

15:10.117 --> 15:11.827
Man, you're a solid 10!

15:11.911 --> 15:13.829
- Wait, what?
- Oh, I know.

15:13.913 --> 15:15.789
Are you guys in Miki's class?

15:15.873 --> 15:17.541
GRADE 2, CLASS 2

15:17.625 --> 15:18.626
STILL HANGING AROUND

15:18.709 --> 15:20.169
Midorikawa, you're from Kansai?

15:20.252 --> 15:21.670
I moved out here for high school.

15:21.754 --> 15:23.339
I love Kansai dialect.

15:23.422 --> 15:24.423
Do you actually?

15:24.506 --> 15:27.635
I wanna say,
"What's up with that?" and stuff.

15:27.718 --> 15:29.762
Your Kansai dialect's all messed up.

15:30.304 --> 15:31.513
Miki!

15:32.139 --> 15:33.599
Heya!

15:33.682 --> 15:35.559
- What's up with that?
- You're using it.

15:35.643 --> 15:37.186
Yuki!

15:37.269 --> 15:38.979
I told you to leave me alone at school!

15:39.063 --> 15:40.439
I'm gonna bother you anyway.

15:40.522 --> 15:41.565
Anyway, here.

15:41.649 --> 15:44.401
Your lunch. You forgot it again.

15:45.027 --> 15:46.028
COMPLETE 180

15:46.111 --> 15:47.112
Thanks, Yuki.

15:47.196 --> 15:48.238
Be grateful.

15:48.781 --> 15:51.241
You don't come to school together?

15:51.325 --> 15:54.787
Nope. Yuki takes forever
getting ready, styling his hair and stuff.

15:54.870 --> 15:57.206
Well, you know...

15:57.289 --> 15:58.290
HMPH

15:58.374 --> 15:59.708
Can't have people lookin' down on me.

15:59.792 --> 16:02.211
You sound like a country bumpkin
delinquent. Knock it off!

16:02.878 --> 16:04.672
- Yuki.
- Yeah?

16:04.755 --> 16:06.966
Think you can make friends?

16:07.049 --> 16:09.218
WHAT? EXPRESSION
FOR "YOU'RE ONE TO TALK"

16:09.301 --> 16:12.471
There's someone I went to middle school
with in my class. I'm not worried.

16:13.222 --> 16:14.348
Good for you.

16:14.431 --> 16:17.851
It's like... she's more composed than usual.

16:17.935 --> 16:20.437
RIGHT NOW - TALKING CASUALLY
USUAL - TIMID AND CAREFUL

16:20.521 --> 16:22.731
She can talk to him
without feeling anxious.

16:22.815 --> 16:24.483
Before I forget.

16:24.566 --> 16:25.943
Come with me, Yuki.

16:26.026 --> 16:27.361
Whoa!

16:27.444 --> 16:29.113
What is it?

16:31.657 --> 16:32.866
Yota.

16:33.450 --> 16:36.036
This is Yuki. He's Miki's younger brother.

16:37.204 --> 16:39.206
You're right. I see the resemblance.

16:39.289 --> 16:40.749
You're massive!

16:40.833 --> 16:42.334
I've heard of you, Yota.

16:43.210 --> 16:45.421
Miki told me about you.

16:45.504 --> 16:46.964
About me?

16:47.464 --> 16:49.008
- Seriously, you're huge.
- Sheesh.

16:49.091 --> 16:51.635
- Train rides must be comfortable.
- She doesn't need to introduce him.

16:51.719 --> 16:53.637
Koyun said the same thing.

16:53.721 --> 16:56.098
He can reach higher than the handrails.

16:56.181 --> 16:57.349
Man, I'm jealous.

17:00.019 --> 17:01.270
Those two...

17:02.521 --> 17:04.606
share a special bond.

17:04.690 --> 17:05.899
Meanwhile, I'm...

17:05.983 --> 17:08.986
You feel more at ease
when there's a familiar face in class.

17:09.570 --> 17:12.823
And she dated Igarashi in the past.

17:15.200 --> 17:16.702
What am I going to do?

17:17.453 --> 17:20.205
I wanted to be genuine friends,
I wanted her to smile...

17:20.706 --> 17:24.001
But there's more to it than
these pure motivations now.

17:27.004 --> 17:31.759
I wish she would only like me.

17:34.678 --> 17:37.181
Hey, guys! Let's all sign up
for the sports festival's cheer squad.

17:37.264 --> 17:38.265
CHEER SQUAD
RECRUITING MEMBERS

17:38.348 --> 17:39.600
Why?

17:39.683 --> 17:42.311
Last year, I passed on it,

17:42.394 --> 17:45.230
then ended up regretting it on the day of.

17:45.314 --> 17:47.983
I told myself I'd do it next time.

17:48.067 --> 17:50.152
So what do you say, guys?

17:50.235 --> 17:51.445
Okay, sure.

17:51.945 --> 17:54.114
- Why not?
- Yes!

17:54.198 --> 17:56.116
You'll join too, right, Minato?

17:56.742 --> 17:58.035
Yeah.

17:59.286 --> 18:00.621
I can't wait!

18:00.704 --> 18:02.706
- A cheer squad full of friends!
- Amazing.

18:02.790 --> 18:05.626
- This is the best!
- They agreed to that easily.

18:05.709 --> 18:07.336
- Now, only one left is...
- That's Miki for you.

18:07.419 --> 18:11.298
Koyun! We're gonna join
the cheer squad! Yeah!

18:11.381 --> 18:13.383
I heard you.

18:13.467 --> 18:15.552
It might be a lot of work, but good luck.

18:16.303 --> 18:17.638
What?

18:22.935 --> 18:23.936
LOOKY

18:24.770 --> 18:26.271
BAM

18:26.772 --> 18:27.773
Why me?

18:28.273 --> 18:29.274
Sorry.

18:29.358 --> 18:32.152
All right, first and second years.

18:32.236 --> 18:35.447
If you haven't memorized
the first part, come over here.

18:35.531 --> 18:37.116
SELF-PRACTICE TIME

18:37.199 --> 18:38.200
Why's Hayato here?

18:38.283 --> 18:40.202
Class 1 and 2 are in the same squad.
Act happy!

18:40.285 --> 18:41.453
HERE
BLUE SQUAD - CLASS 1 AND 2

18:41.537 --> 18:42.538
WINGING IT

18:42.621 --> 18:44.832
Go swoosh, swoosh, then boom.

18:45.415 --> 18:46.416
Koyun.

18:47.042 --> 18:48.961
Want me to teach you
the parts you don't know?

18:49.044 --> 18:50.045
GASP

18:50.129 --> 18:51.213
A scary guy came over!

18:51.296 --> 18:53.715
- Don't be afraid.
- What?

18:53.799 --> 18:55.551
Meet Yuki, Miki's younger brother.

18:55.634 --> 18:56.677
Good to meet ya!

18:56.760 --> 18:57.761
PHEW

18:57.845 --> 18:59.471
- Oh, I see.
- Don't introduce him.

18:59.555 --> 19:01.348
Shoo! Off you go.

19:01.431 --> 19:02.641
Why?

19:02.724 --> 19:04.643
- Just go!
- She's scaring me.

19:04.726 --> 19:06.353
Help me, Koyun.

19:06.436 --> 19:07.980
Don't fight, you two.

19:08.063 --> 19:09.982
Guess I've gotta leave now.

19:10.065 --> 19:11.400
Now start walking!

19:11.483 --> 19:12.651
Bye!

19:12.734 --> 19:13.986
See you, Yuki.

19:16.989 --> 19:17.990
POKE

19:18.615 --> 19:21.034
Practice ended earlier than we thought.

19:21.118 --> 19:22.536
Your finger...

19:22.619 --> 19:23.620
GEEZ

19:23.704 --> 19:25.831
I just exercised, so my face is sweaty.

19:25.914 --> 19:27.499
That's what makes you upset?

19:27.583 --> 19:28.584
STARE

19:28.667 --> 19:30.752
- Do you have club activities after this?
- Yeah.

19:31.253 --> 19:33.255
You've got cheer squad
and your club? That's tough.

19:33.338 --> 19:34.673
Not really.

19:34.756 --> 19:35.757
What's this?

19:36.717 --> 19:38.010
Is this what I think it is?

19:39.303 --> 19:40.512
Could this be...

19:40.596 --> 19:43.348
Am I third-wheeling?

19:43.849 --> 19:45.767
SWISH

19:45.851 --> 19:46.935
Are you in a club, Shimojima?

19:47.019 --> 19:48.020
JOLT!

19:48.103 --> 19:49.688
He's talking to me now!

19:49.771 --> 19:51.690
I-I'm in art club.

19:51.773 --> 19:53.775
Were you in the cheer squad last year?

19:53.859 --> 19:57.279
It's fine, Amamiya.
You don't have to include me.

19:57.362 --> 19:59.281
I talked her into it.

19:59.364 --> 20:01.241
- What should I do?
- How do you two know each other?

20:01.325 --> 20:03.869
- I'd hate to be a third wheel...
- Last year, in March...

20:03.952 --> 20:05.537
...but I do want to keep watching.

20:05.621 --> 20:07.789
CURIOSITY - BEING CONSIDERATE
HEE, HEE

20:08.874 --> 20:13.045
Goodness. I'm so done with practice!

20:13.128 --> 20:14.504
I'm wiped.

20:14.588 --> 20:16.215
It's only the first day.

20:16.298 --> 20:18.634
Try to be more like
the energetic kids chatting over there.

20:18.717 --> 20:19.718
CHATTER, CHATTER

20:19.801 --> 20:22.054
You mean the first years?

20:22.554 --> 20:25.807
Yeah, lots of flashy kids this year.

20:25.891 --> 20:26.892
NEAR-SIGHTED

20:26.975 --> 20:30.062
What's goin' on with Meiten?
This isn't our usual cohort.

20:30.145 --> 20:34.274
That reminds me.
Earlier, I spotted two flashy students

20:34.358 --> 20:36.318
who looked like celebrities.

20:36.401 --> 20:38.237
- Seriously? Where?
- Right there.

20:38.320 --> 20:39.321
NEAR-SIGHTED

20:39.404 --> 20:40.948
See them?

20:41.031 --> 20:44.368
The tall one with the bun
and the one with long hair.

20:44.993 --> 20:46.453
Practice is done.

20:46.536 --> 20:49.456
What're you gonna do, Akine?
Are you going home?

20:50.374 --> 20:51.416
Not quite.

20:51.500 --> 20:53.210
Momoka, you go home without me.

20:54.378 --> 20:56.964
There's someone I want to meet.

20:58.215 --> 20:59.216
See you.

21:06.181 --> 21:08.183
Does the library ever get busy?

21:08.267 --> 21:10.185
Not really.

21:10.269 --> 21:13.563
That girl... she's staring right at us.

21:18.193 --> 21:19.361
Heya.

21:20.320 --> 21:23.115
- You stopped by about the manager role.
- Yes.

21:23.198 --> 21:25.617
I guess she's
an acquaintance of Amamiya's.

21:26.201 --> 21:27.703
Will you be coming after this today?

21:27.786 --> 21:29.997
Yes. I look forward to seeing you there.

21:48.098 --> 21:50.642
Koyuki Yuishiro.

21:51.727 --> 21:52.978
Yuishiro?

21:53.478 --> 21:57.399
Huh? Atagawa, do you know Hikawa?

21:58.317 --> 21:59.651
Atagawa...

22:00.235 --> 22:01.236
Yes.

22:01.320 --> 22:02.904
I'm Akine Atagawa.

22:03.822 --> 22:06.199
I'm from the same middle school as Azumi.

22:06.283 --> 22:08.994
I heard all about you, Koyuki.

22:09.536 --> 22:11.913
Akine Atagawa...

22:12.539 --> 22:13.623
She can't be...

22:15.208 --> 22:18.670
I look forward to getting to know you.

22:19.504 --> 22:20.922
She's Manatsu Atagawa's...

22:22.132 --> 22:23.175
younger sister...

23:50.262 --> 23:55.267
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
